You have several options. One option would certainly be the one mentioned by Mauricio, namely to use the indProd function, define a new factor and parameterize the model like an ordinary moderator regression. (but with factors). You don't need a new parameter (:=), at least I don't know why. Alternatively you can think about nlsem. This package also handles lavaan code (to a certain degree).

