+             mBDIII.SUM ~~ mBDIII.SUM
+             TAI.SUM ~~ TAI.SUM
+             mBDIII.SUM ~~ TAI.SUM
+             BPD.Sum ~~ BPD.Sum
+             SUD.sum ~~ SUD.sum'
